= The Admirals Move

Star Destroyers take station over the Senate district. Wilhuff Tarkin addresses the galaxy: the Senate has failed, the war must be won, and a Council of Admirals will govern "until victory".

The Senate Guard, still answering only to the Chancellery, stands aside. Within a day the Republic's Senate is a museum.

*Fear was at 60 or more, Tarkin led the Security Bloc, the Navy's loyalty to the Senate was below 50%, and the Senate Guard had not been reformed.*
